  "provenance": {
    "kind": "prescribed",
    "description": "SYNTHETIC average-regional forcing, not an observed year and not a Jornada station record: each calendar month of 2027 repeats the NOAA/NWS El Paso 1991-2020 monthly-normal daily minimum and maximum temperature (degF converted exactly with C=(F-32)*5/9 and rounded to 9 decimals) on every day of that month. No interpolation between months, no daily variability, no extremes, no frost events. Humidity and shortwave radiation are deliberately NOT supplied (no values invented). Daily mean temperature is derived by the model as the arithmetic mean of tmin and tmax (differs slightly from the published normal mean). PET is requested from the owning SYRUP ecohyd_hargreaves implementation at run time (none computed here); it needs a latitude bound from the MAPLE case.yaml location.latitude_deg (author proxy 31.8 degrees N, see ../landscape.toml), which is not a weather field. 2027 is a 365-day calendar year in fixed MST (UTC-07:00, no DST).",
    "source": "NOAA/NWS El Paso area climate page https://www.weather.gov/epz/epz_area_climate (1991-2020 normals); LEAF case jornada_grass05_shrub10_256 climate/monthly_normals.csv; authored 2026-11-11"
  },
